<title>POLAND: Elektrobudowa revises down H1 pre-tax.</title>
<headline>Elektrobudowa revises down H1 pre-tax.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA final results for six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 H1 1996    H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			14.59 vs    7.71</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  13.71 vs    6.58</p>
<p>    net profit				 7.87 vs    4.15</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Elektrobudowa SA. Earlier the company reported a pre-tax profit of 19.23 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    net sales				106.78 vs   67.41</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  86.66 vs   57.31</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.02 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 5.83 vs    2.33</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.10</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.71 vs    0.40</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.57 vs    1.54</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
